  "_note": "The fontconfig XML this project is allowed to emit, with the element vocabulary and attribute enumerations from the configuration DTD. fontconfig warns about an element or attribute it does not know and keeps loading, and a family that is not installed simply never matches, so neither mistake is visible to the user. gen_fontconfig.py refuses to write a fonts.conf that uses an element, an attribute or an enumerated value that is not recorded here, or a family the design tokens do not name.",
